    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `select_platform_resource.py` that resolves a provider-specific model, deployment, or inference resource before invocation, I need to choose a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon Web Services (AWS) as the provider and specifically use the Amazon SageMaker service to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865316430,
          "start": 1789865314177
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc494781001v08pDQk7RemCie",
