    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file that invokes a provider-managed model. I will choose Amazon Bedrock as the concrete external provider and use its specific model identifier in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865308778,
          "start": 1789865306989
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc492b6d001QmN9HaPkICol85",
